The spectral attack is decisive in practice as well as algebraically: on 20/20 independent shipping seeds, the \(-3\) eigenspace had dimension two, its row embeddings split into three groups of 60, and the resulting colourings produced jump sequences accepted by `verify`. This is a polynomial-time attack with 100% success on the test panel, so H and G6 fail.
