Rejected the family and documented the evidence in [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2408.04743/REJECTED.md).

The attempted bounded Token Jumping generator passed its initial gates and LLM hardening, but a polynomial spectral attack recovered valid witnesses on 20/20 shipping instances. Its planted colour classes form an exact \(-3\) eigenspace, exposing the answer. This aligns with published planted-colouring recovery results ([David–Feige](https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.05183), [Kumar–Louis–Tulsiani](https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.FSTTCS.2017.37)).

Therefore H and G6 fail. The invalid generator, README, self-test report, and oracle transcript were removed to prevent accidental shipment.
